<DocPage
  title="About"
  description="About bootstrap-validate."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <p>
    bootstrap-validate is a small form validation utility by Pascale Beier. It
    supports Bootstrap 3 and Bootstrap 4. Version 2.3.0 is the final Bootstrap 4
    compatibility release, and Bootstrap 5 support is planned for the version 3
    refactor.
  </p>

